  "body_html": "<h1>Strategy Profile</h1>\n<p>Given a strategic game \\((I, (S_i), (u_i))\\), a strategy profile is a tuple\n\\(\\sigma = (\\sigma_i)_{i \\in I}\\) where \\(\\sigma_i \\in S_i\\) for each player \\(i\\).</p>\n<p>In Lean, a profile is <code>∀ i, G.strategy i</code>.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MSZ, Chapter 2] Maschler, Solan, and Zamir, <em>Game Theory</em>. Definition of strategy profile.</li>\n</ul>",
